ions on your phone to set the night  time mode where you can keep the  notifications switched off and minimize  distractions  at least 30 minutes before your bedtime  you don't always have to  be connected on your phone instead spend  the time to  really connect with your loved ones  before bedtime  sleep is one of the most important  aspects of our life  health and longevity yet it is  increasingly neglected in society  nowadays  due to work electronic devices and so on  when we sleep we wake up feeling  refreshed and alert to start our day  sleep affects how we look  feel and perform on a daily basis and  can have a major impact on our  overall quality of life beyond just  eating well  and exercising regularly sleep is one of  the most important  aspects in losing weight and maintaining  a healthy weight for life  so what are your sleeping habits let me  know in the comments below  and what areas can you improve on if you  find this video to be useful  do give this video a thumbs up share it  on with your friends  and do also check out other fitness  videos on my youtube channel  don't forget to hit the subscribe button  and  get off your mobile phone and get some  sleep and i will see you next time  all the best

